    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-title">
        <h1 class="title is-1 is-narrow">The home of excellence in the construction industry</h1>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Non enim quaero quid verum, sed quid cuique dicendum sit. Quid affers, cur Thorius, cur Caius.</p>
      </div>

      <div x-data="initHomeSwiper()" class="carousel-container">
